  "description": "JOYSTAR Pluto 2.0 Kids Bike - With Flash Training Wheels & Water Bottle\nIgnite the spirit of adventure with the JOYSTAR Pluto 2.0. Inspired by BMX freestyle design, this sporty ride is built for fun, freedom, and creativity, making it the perfect choice for the next cycling star aged 3-13.\n\nThe JOYSTAR Pluto 2.0: Sporty BMX style for endless outdoor fun.\n\nPerformance & Safety Engineering\n\"Built for every adventure. Every frame, every component, and every detail of a JOYSTAR is built JUST for kids.\"\nAdvanced Safety & Control\nThe Pluto 2.0 features a sturdy steel frame designed for stability and durability. To ensure reliable stopping power, it comes equipped with a dual-braking system (front caliper brake and rear coaster brake), allowing young riders to master speed control safely.\n\nReliable dual brakes and a rugged frame for total riding confidence.\n\nKey Features & Benefits\n\nFlash Training Wheels: Battery-free LED wheels that light up as they spin for extra fun and visibility.\n\nStay Hydrated: Includes a dedicated water bottle and holder mounted to the frame for active days out.\n\nComfortable Ride: Features a high-quality comfort saddle and pneumatic tires for smooth handling on various terrains.\n\nFull Protection: A total chain guard protects small hands and feet from moving parts.\n\nQuick & Easy Assembly\nWe know you're eager to get riding! The JOYSTAR Pluto 2.0 arrives 85% pre-assembled. With the included tools and clear instructions, you can have your child’s new bike ready for the sidewalk in about 20 minutes.\n\nStep-by-step assembly: From box to backyard in minutes.\n\nSize Chart & Fit Guide\n\nSee It In Action\n\nWatch the Pluto 2.0 in action: Built for speed, safety, and smiles.\n\nOur Guarantee\nJOYSTAR provides a competitive warranty to ensure your child enjoys their ride for years to come:\n\nLifetime Warranty (Frame): Steel frames are guaranteed against manufacturing defects for the original owner.\n\n2-Year Warranty (Components): Non-wear parts like forks and handlebars are covered for two years.\n\nRegistration Bonus: JOYSTAR often extends a Limited Lifetime Warranty to the original owner if the bike is registered on our official website shortly after purchase.\n\nCustomer Support: Our team is ready to assist with any issues or assembly questions to ensure a safe ride.",
